<title>USA: Sizeler Property Investors Inc Q3 shr down.</title>
<headline>Sizeler Property Investors Inc Q3 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended September 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		  1995</p>
<p> Operating revenue		$ 11,167,000	$ 10,758,000</p>
<p> Net income				531,000	     692,000</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			  8,423,000	   8,557,000</p>
<p>Per share:</p>
<p>  Net income				  0.06		  0.08</p>
<p>  Funds from operations		   0.32		  0.31</p>
<p>				     Nine Months Ended September 30,</p>
<p>						  1996		 1995</p>
<p> Operating revenue		$ 32,931,000	$ 31,889,000</p>
<p> Net income			    1,219,000	   2,008,000</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			  8,436,000	   8,757,000</p>
<p>Per share:</p>
<p>  Net income				  0.14		  0.23</p>
<p>  Funds from operations		   0.95		  0.89</p>
<p>NOTE - Effective January 1, 1996, the company adopted the new definition of funds from operations, as established by the National Association of Real Estate Investment Trusts (NAREIT). Funds from operations is defined as net income, excluding gains (or losses) from sales of investments and other non-operating extraordinary items, plus depreciation on real estate assets and after adjustments for unconsolidated ventures to reflect funds from operations on the same basis. For comparative purposes, funds from operations for the three- and nine-month periods ending September 30, 1995, has been presented using the new NAREIT definition.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
